    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "Four sounds",
      "body": "Major is bright. Minor is dark. Diminished is tense and squeezed. Augmented floats, as if it is stretched.\n\n**Why it matters:** these four sounds are the building blocks of nearly every chord you will hear a band play.",
